{"ticker":"TSCO","updated":"2026-11-07T01:59:43Z","profile":{"longName":"Tractor Supply Company","shortName":"Tractor Supply Company","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Specialty Retail","country":"United States","website":"https://www.tractorsupply.com","fullTimeEmployees":54000,"marketCap":18939807744,"trailingPE":19.54301,"forwardPE":17.628258,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.1880347,"pegRatio":2.63,"targetMeanPrice":37.40741,"targetHighPrice":43.0,"targetLowPrice":31.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":27,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.051,"earningsGrowth":-0.121,"grossMargins":0.36247003,"operatingMargins":0.07869,"profitMargins":0.061300002,"totalRevenue":15942134784,"beta":0.484,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":56.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":28.36,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.62},"summary":"Tractor Supply Company operates as a rural lifestyle retailer in the United States. The company provides various merchandise, including livestock and equine feed and equipment, poultry, fencing, and sprayers and chemicals; companion animal products, such as food, treats, and equipment for dogs, cats, and other small animals, as well as dog wellness products; seasonal and recreation products comprising tractors and riders, lawn and garden, bird feeding, power equipment, and other recreational products; truck, tool, and hardware products, such as truck accessories, trailers, generators, lubricants, batteries, and hardware and tools; and clothing, gift, and décor products consist of clothing, footwear, toys, snacks, and decorative merchandise. It offers its products under the 4health, Paws & Claws, American Farmworks, Producer's Pride, Bit & Bridle, Red Shed, Blue Mountain, Redstone, C.E. Schmidt, Retriever, Country Lane, Ridgecut, Countyline, Royal Wing, Country Tuff, Strive, Dumor, Traveller, Farm Table, Treeline, Groundwork, TSC Tractor Supply Co, Huskee, Untamed, JobSmart, and Impeckable brand names. The company operates its retail stores under the Tractor Supply Company, Petsense by Tractor Supply, and Orscheln Farm and Home names; and operates websites under the TractorSupply.com and Petsense.com names. It sells its products to recreational farmers, ranchers, and others. Tra","summary_zh":"Tractor Supply Company 在美国经营一家乡村生活方式零售商。該公司提供各種商品，包括牲畜和馬飼料和設備、家禽、圍欄、噴霧器和化學品；伴侶動物產品，例如狗、貓和其他小動物的食品、零食和設備，以及狗保健產品；季節性和娛樂產品，包括拖拉機和騎手、草坪和花園、餵鳥、電力設備和其他娛樂產品；卡車、工具和五金產品，例如用品、用品、用品、用品和產品、服裝用品、產品、用品和用品、用品和產品、用品和用品。它以 4health、Paws & Claws、American Farmworks、Producer's Pride、Bit & Bridle、Red Shed、Blue Mountain、Redstone、C.E. Schmidt、Retriever、Country Lane、Ridgecut、Countyline、Royal Wing、Country Tuff、Strive、Country Lane、Ridgecut、Countyline、Royal Wing、Country Tuff、Strive、Dumors、Grek、Suppm、Treeal Wing、Country Tuff、Grive、Dumor)、Treemoline、Firctor、Groundm、Gr Co、Huskee、Untamed、JobSmart 和 Impeckable 品牌提供产品名称。該公司以 Tractor Supply Company、Petsense by Tractor Supply 和 Orscheln Farm and Home 等名稱經營零售店；並以 TractorSupply.com 和 Petsense.com 名義經營網站。它向休闲农民、牧场主和其他人销售其产品。特拉","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"專業零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":60.36,"h":60.46,"l":59.12,"c":60.09,"v":5475400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":59.8,"h":59.96,"l":58.82,"c":59.08,"v":3722000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":58.74,"h":59.15,"l":58.25,"c":58.45,"v":3129300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":58.54,"h":60.26,"l":58.47,"c":60.02,"v":3798700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":59.7,"h":60.65,"l":59.58,"c":60.61,"v":4395300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":60.53,"h":60.86,"l":59.55,"c":59.61,"v":6271000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":59.55,"h":59.83,"l":58.48,"c":58.99,"v":5254500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":59.19,"h":60.01,"l":58.89,"c":59.1,"v":3551300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":59.61,"h":60.37,"l":59.3,"c":59.87,"v":4153800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":60.04,"h":60.15,"l":59.04,"c":59.66,"v":6769900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":59.49,"h":59.64,"l":58.11,"c":58.14,"v":4335700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":58.31,"h":58.68,"l":58.06,"c":58.56,"v":3024500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":58.25,"h":58.28,"l":57.22,"c":57.35,"v":4808900},{"t":"2025-09-25",